{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"やーい(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幸せな事があったんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにお裾分けしたい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/08/6426316/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにこの絶景！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハーフツインテールのみり愛ちゃんが\n自分のお腹の上で寝てると思って見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お裾分けです！\n自慢じゃないです！\n自慢じゃないです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐへへへへへへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は映画観てきました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、家に帰るほどでもない空き時間は\nだいたい映画行きます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は『バクマン。』を観ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/08/6426316/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここさけぶりの映画"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/08/6426316/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当は『ヒロイン失格』を観に行ったんだけど\n『バクマン。』 が調度いい時間にやってたから\nそっちにしたのね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ネタバレ怖いからざっくり言うと\n少年ジャンプのお話しなんですね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも中田は\n普段あんまり漫画読まないし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさん有名な作品がある少年ジャンプでも\n『ONE PIECE』『BLEACH』『D.Gray-man』『いぬまるだしっ』\nを単行本で少し見たことあるかな程度なんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なのに すごい面白かった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お仕事頑張ろうと思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今、お仕事に向かう道中でごさいます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2015/10/08/6426316/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}